Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.26,0:04:56.01,hmz,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,0)\fs14\pos(171,127)}伺服器
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.26,0:04:56.01,hmz,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,0)\fs14\pos(220,138)}日本伺服器
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.26,0:04:56.01,hmz,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,0)\fs14\pos(164,162)}區域
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.26,0:04:56.01,hmz,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,0)\fs14\pos(241,174)}南富士地區
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.26,0:04:56.01,hmz,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,0)\fs14\pos(166,197)}區劃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.26,0:04:56.01,hmz,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,0)\fs13\pos(314,209)}市區/無怪物出沒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.26,0:04:56.01,hmz,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,0)\fs14\pos(164,233)}其他
